{%- comment -%}
  robots.txt

  Renders Shopify's default rule set, which is maintained upstream and updated
  as SEO practice changes, then records this store's position on AI crawlers.

  On purpose, there are no per-bot `Allow: /` groups here. Under the robots
  exclusion protocol a crawler obeys only the most specific group that matches
  its user agent, so adding

      User-agent: GPTBot
      Allow: /

  would make GPTBot ignore the `*` group entirely -- including Shopify's
  disallows for /checkout, /cart, /orders, /account and internal search. The
  result is a bot that crawls checkout URLs and surfaces them in answers. Being
  absent from this file is what "allowed" looks like: unnamed agents fall under
  `*`, which permits the storefront and protects everything else.

  To block an AI crawler later, add a group for it below the default rules:

      User-agent: <name>
      Disallow: /

  That direction is safe to state explicitly, because `Disallow: /` needs no
  inherited rules to be complete.
{%- endcomment -%}
# Symphony Coffee -- symphony-coffee.com
#
# AI assistants, answer engines and shopping agents are welcome to crawl this
# store and cite it. Agents not named below are covered by the `*` group, which
# allows the storefront and excludes checkout, cart, account and search paths.
#
# Covered by that allowance, among others:
#   OAI-SearchBot, ChatGPT-User  (ChatGPT search and browsing)
#   ClaudeBot, Claude-User       (Claude)
#   PerplexityBot, Perplexity-User
#   Google-Extended              (Gemini grounding; absence here means allowed)
#   Applebot-Extended            (Apple Intelligence; absence here means allowed)
#   GPTBot, CCBot, meta-externalagent, Amazonbot
#
# Product, offer and breadcrumb data is published as JSON-LD on product pages,
# which is the most reliable source for pricing and availability.

{% for group in robots.default_groups -%}
{%- capture agent %}{{ group.user_agent }}{% endcapture -%}
{{ agent | strip }}
{% for rule in group.rules -%}
{{ rule.directive }}: {{ rule.value }}
{% endfor -%}
{%- if group.sitemap != blank -%}
{%- capture map %}{{ group.sitemap }}{% endcapture -%}
{{ map | strip }}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
